  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "kinetics400-grt-video-masks",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tKinetics-400 GRT Video Masks\n\t\n\nPrecomputed GRT disocclusion masks for Kinetics-400 videos, released for Geometric Reciprocity: Unlocking Self-Supervision for Stereoscopic Video Generation (ICML 2026).\n\nSource videos: Kinetics-400\nDepth model: Video Depth Anything Large\nRelative stereo shift scale: 0.06 * video_width\nFormat: compressed .npz, one mask sequence per video\nTotal masks: 298,337 videos (239,789 train, 19,877 val, 38,671 test)\nShards: 2,984 tar shards with matching .done\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/LuJingyi/kinetics400-grt-video-masks.",
